  steps:
  - id: 0
    text: Welcome to Sonus! Let's go over a couple things to help you explore the
      demo app.
    position: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrow: 0
    dimBackground: 0
  - id: 1
    text: You can load preset demo missions here
    position: {x: 305, y: 182}
    arrow: 2
    dimBackground: 0
  - id: 2
    text: Once a mission has been loaded, you can set the active target to track
      here.
    position: {x: 386, y: 84}
    arrow: 2
    dimBackground: 0
  - id: 3
    text: To View the Mission in simulated AR or Sonic Tracking, jump into the scene
      with this button
    position: {x: -297, y: -290}
    arrow: 4
    dimBackground: 0
  - id: 4
    text: You can also manually add targets to the scene
    position: {x: -333, y: 69}
    arrow: 4
    dimBackground: 0
  - id: 5
    text: At any time, you can remove all targets from the scene here.
    position: {x: 330, y: -135}
    arrow: 2
    dimBackground: 0
  - id: 6
    text: The next update will include a Sonus Hunt game so you can see if tracking
      targets sonically is a viable approach or not!
    position: {x: 321, y: -330}
    arrow: 2
    dimBackground: 0
  - id: 7
    text: That's all for now, go ahead and either load a mission, or start adding
      your own targets to track with SONUS!
    position: {x: 0, y: 0}
    arrow: 0
    dimBackground: 0
  showOnStart: 1
  showOnceKey: FTUE_Main
  fadeDuration: 0.25
  debugLogs: 0
